# sds-lane-rotation-decomposer's schedule: one acting pass every hour, as the Mac job's
# `StartInterval` of 3600 runs it (`scripts/com.devon.rotation-decomposer.plist`), in the image's
# America/New_York time. The decomposer takes no acting flag: every run but `--dry-run` proposes,
# tells alert-hub and pings its outcome alarm, and the plist passes no arguments. Minute 50 is one
# no other lane uses: execution-watch runs on the quarter-hours, the unit verifier on 2-52/10, the
# deploy watcher on 20, the pin watcher on 07:25, the landing ledger on 07:30, the change proposer
# on 35, the revision watcher on 40 and the membership check on 07:47. The entrypoint runs this file
# only when LANE_SCHEDULE_ENABLED is `true`.
50 * * * * lane-run rotation-decomposer
